          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "SUMMARY"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.568,
            0.727,
            0.588
          ],
          "content": " We explored and learnt various properties of divisibility —"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.593,
            0.775,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": "• If a is divisible by b, then all multiples of a are divisible by b."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.617,
            0.771,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": "• If a is divisible by b, then a is divisible by all the factors of b."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.643,
            0.781,
            0.662
          ],
          "content": "• If a divides m and a divides n, then a divides m + n and m – n."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.667,
            0.823,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": "If a is divisible by b and is also divisible by c, then a is divisible by the LCM of b and c."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.712,
            0.823,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "We learnt shortcuts to check divisibility by 3, 9 and 11, and why they work."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.756,
            0.824,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": "Through all this we were exposed to the power of mathematical thinking and reasoning, using algebra, visualisation, examples and counterexamples."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.079,
            0.915,
